{"translation-revision-date":"2026-11-03 18:25:07+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;","lang":"es"},"Region":["Regi\u00f3n"],"Use your generated URLs in social posts, emails, or ads. Jetpack Stats will track UTM codes, giving you accurate insights into your traffic.":["Utiliza las URL generadas en entradas de redes sociales, correos electr\u00f3nicos o anuncios. Jetpack Stats har\u00e1 un seguimiento de los c\u00f3digos UTM y te ofrecer\u00e1 informaci\u00f3n precisa sobre tu tr\u00e1fico."],"Example: email, social, cpc":["Ejemplo: correo electr\u00f3nico, redes sociales, CPC"],"Define the channel type":["Define el tipo de canal"],"Example: newsletter, facebook, google":["Ejemplo: newsletter, Facebook, Google"],"Define where traffic originates":["Define d\u00f3nde se origina el tr\u00e1fico"],"Example: christmas, flash-sale":["Ejemplo: Navidad, oferta rel\u00e1mpago"],"Name your campaign":["Ponle nombre a tu campa\u00f1a"],"UTM codes help track where your traffic comes from. Adding them to your URLs gives you insights into what works and where to optimize.":["Los c\u00f3digos UTM ayudan a rastrear de d\u00f3nde proviene tu tr\u00e1fico. Si los a\u00f1ades a tus URL, obtendr\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n sobre qu\u00e9 funciona y d\u00f3nde optimizarlos."],"Why should I use this?":["\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 deber\u00eda usar esto?"],"Fill out campaign parameters to see the URL":["Rellena los par\u00e1metros de la campa\u00f1a para ver la URL"],"Enter a destination URL to see the URL":["Introduce una URL de destino para ver la URL"],"Your URL to share":["Tu URL para compartir"],"e.g. email, social":["p. ej., correo electr\u00f3nico, redes sociales"],"UTM medium":["Medio del UTM"],"e.g. newsletter":["p. ej., newsletter"],"UTM source":["Fuente del UTM"],"e.g. promotion":["p. ej., promoci\u00f3n"],"UTM campaign":["Campa\u00f1a del UTM"],"Destination URL":["URL de destin